taris-wallpapers

These wallpapers aren't TarisOS's work, and TarisOS's licence doesn't cover them. They were
collected from wallhaven (https://wallhaven.cc/) and from Omarchy (https://omarchy.org/), and
their original artists couldn't be found. Each one remains its artist's.

If you made one of them, or know who did, please open an issue at
https://github.com/TarisOS/tarisOS/issues and we'll be happy to credit them. An artist who would
rather a wallpaper weren't included can ask for it to be removed, with sufficient evidence that
it's theirs.
